列表切片进行赋值，会把切片部分替换成等号右边的列表元素。 所以 l[3:] 表示替换索引 3 之后的元素（当前是空）。这实际上相当于在索引 3 处插入 [1, 2, 3] 。 步骤 原列表： 索引 0 1 2 元素 4 5 6 l[3:] 对应的位置是在 6 之后（空的部分）。 用 [1, 2, 3] 替换这个空部分，就相当于在列表末尾拼接上 [1, 2, 3] 。 结果： [4, 5, 6, 1, 2, 3]","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"numbers = [1, 3, 2, 8], numbers[len(numbers) - 1]会返回什么？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：1"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：3"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：2"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：8"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"str = \"学习力,思考力,行动力,创造力\"，运行print(str[4:7])的结果是？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：思考力,"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：,思考力"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：思考力"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：,思考力,"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下面代码将打印出什么数字？"},{"t":"numbers = [1,3,2,8,9]\r\n\r\nprint(numbers[1]+numbers[3])"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：3"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：11"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：4"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：9"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"d1 = {'a': 100, 'b': 200, 'c':300}，下面什么代码可以将d1改成{'a': 150, 'b':200, 'c':300}？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：d1[0] = 150"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：d1[a] = 150"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：d1['a'] = 150"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d1[100] = 150"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"words = {\"Chinese\":\"中文\", \"English\":\"英语\", \"French\":\"法语\", \"Korean\":\"韩语\"}，运行以下代码后输出的结果是？"},{"t":"del words[\"French\"] \r\n\r\nprint(len(words))"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：6"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：3"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：8"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：4"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列关于字符串的描述正确的是？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：字符串是一个可变的序列"}]},{"key":"B","conten